# .sandbox/skills — which agent skills this project's sessions get.
#
# One regular expression per line, matched against the whole skill name
# (the directory holding its SKILL.md). Candidates are every skill in the
# project's and your own skill directories (.agents/skills, .claude/skills,
# ...); project skills shadow yours of the same name. scoder's own skills
# are always included.
#
# Examples:
#   web-search
#   deep-research|arxiv-.*
#
# The default keeps every skill:
.*
